[{"title":"题端阳李太守甘霖重应卷","author":"陈献章","text":"岭南名刺史，端阳有成绩。\n端阳问为谁，长沙垂令德。\n曰惟长沙公，善非一代积。\n去年苗欲槁，公寝不安席。\n手拈一炷香，须臾见昭假。\n今年事复然，斯民忻目击。\n甘霖雨下土，郊野望四塞。\n滂沱及邻壤，秋田足民食。\n公惠宁有心，斯民感公德。\n口颂遂成碑，举手还加额。\n安得长沙公，为我大邦伯。\n坐令十郡内，广布阳春泽。\n闾阎兴孝悌，四野无盗贼。\n共育太和春，絪缊谢反侧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41637,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶得寄东所二首 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"知暮则知朝，西风涨暮潮。\n千秋一何短，瞬息一何遥。\n有物万象间，不随万象凋。\n举目如见之，何必穷扶摇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41638,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶得寄东所二首 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"登高未必高，老脚且平步。\n平步人不疑，东西任四顾。\n岂无见在心，何必拟诸古。\n异体骨肉亲，有生皆我与。\n失之万里途，得之咫尺许。\n得失在斯须，谁能别来去。\n明日立秋来，人方思处暑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41639,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和罗服周对菊见寄","author":"陈献章","text":"春来苦不早，春去常愿迟。\n嗟哉造化机，万物安得知。\n岁晏菊始吐，鲜鲜在东篱。\n不污桃李尘，永续徵君诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41640,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龟山夜月","author":"陈献章","text":"万古此龟山，万古此明月。\n开帘望龟山，岱宗固无别。\n但恐山多云，风吹乱人睫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41641,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马牙香","author":"陈献章","text":"炉中煨白术，坐上有青天。\n绮季奕未毕，夷齐上西山。\n沉檀皆下品，欲语不同年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41642,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题心泉赠黄叔仁","author":"陈献章","text":"夜半汲山井，山泉日日新。\n不将泉照面，白日多飞尘。\n飞尘亦无害，莫弄桔槔频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠伍弼归觐","author":"陈献章","text":"诸生胡不归，九月望庭闱。\n山北山南道，纷纷落叶飞。\n呼儿巾木榻，谢客掩荆扉。\n不尽来时约，堪沾别处衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真乐吟效康节体","author":"陈献章","text":"真乐何从生，觉者不复言。\n或疑诗语工，或云饮者贤。\n或书役心情，或琴以自宣。\n真乐生于心，乃在至和间。\n行如云在天，止如水在渊。\n静者识其端，此心当乾乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得何时矩书","author":"陈献章","text":"良友惠我书，书中竟何如。\n上言我所忧，下述君所移。\n开缄读三四，亦足破烦污。\n丈夫立万仞，肯受寻尺拘。\n不见柴桑人，丐食能欢娱。\n孟轲走四方，从者数十车。\n出处固有间，谁能别贤愚。\n鄙夫患得失，较计于其初。\n高天与深渊，悬绝徒嗟吁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"偶然风折木，村犬吠成群。\n此事真难免，问君闻不闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"辛苦南邻臼，远鸡方一鸣。\n夜来风极急，吹断到窗声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"冬眠不觉晓，开门见白云。\n云中何所有，童子两三人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其一 光霁岩","author":"陈献章","text":"风月佳名在，乾坤浪迹空。\n从来岩下客，祇与异人逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其二 翠华岩","author":"陈献章","text":"来说湖西者，不及华山顶。\n谁知岩中仙，解作石柱屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其三 清风岩","author":"陈献章","text":"声从窦中来，可以塞天地。\n借问采薇人，便知风动处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其四 府教岩","author":"陈献章","text":"府教英灵在，虺蛇不敢居。\n从来岩上月，只是照虚无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其五 极清岩","author":"陈献章","text":"声名野老畏，草石贵人争。\n刬却岩中有，悠悠是极清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其六 英公岩","author":"陈献章","text":"翠掩千寻洞，青窥一窍天。\n人间无绝境，不要问桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41655,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其七 扇和岩","author":"陈献章","text":"山骨短圆棱，初疑削木成。\n乾坤藏一柱，犹得镇岩扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41656,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其八 卧龙岩","author":"陈献章","text":"龙出潭水空，龙归潭水黑。\n君从龙床来，谁在龙床侧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41657,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖西九岩为一峰题 其九 月岩","author":"陈献章","text":"闇闇月堕地，忽在天中央。\n堕地人不觉，中天照四方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41658,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题慈元庙","author":"陈献章","text":"慈元一片石，长留何处山。\n厓门潮日至，雪浪飞天关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"陈献章","text":"金笼锁鹦鹉，山木纵斑鸠。\n巧拙知谁是，天机不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294