0d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村步杂书所见 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"晚食南山稻，堂堂愧野人。\n平生无可说，一个白头亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村步杂书所见 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"村笛轰牛背，山花结帽头。\n骑牛胜骑马，曲坂没郎愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村步杂书所见 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"趁罢江门市，商船夺港归。\n溪山愁引望，城郭更须知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村步杂书所见 其六","author":"陈献章","text":"日照南浦口，初喧江市人。\n小奴性嗜酒，出饮畏吾嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏赠求书饶大中还江右","author":"陈献章","text":"书法一家成，风波几月程。\n孤舟愁度险，荐福有雷声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代简答方伯彭公 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"大贤望于人，往往非独守。\n难将一人意，满足天下口。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代简答方伯彭公 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"氤氲复氤氲，东君欲放春。\n梅花何太早，早报越城人。","co